    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_103_angel_1#8"
    },
    {
        "text": "Yahoo!",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Exusiai"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_103_angel_1#8",
        "name2": "char_201_moeshd#2",
        "focus": 2
    },
    {
        "text": "Eyes on the road, Exusiai! Hands on ten and two!",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Croissant"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_102_texas_1"
    },
    {
        "text": "I finally caught you.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Texas"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_102_texas_1",
        "name2": "char_101_sora_1#4",
        "focus": 2
    },
    {
        "text": "Texas... please... slower next time...",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Sora"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_102_texas_1",
        "name2": "char_101_sora_1#4",
        "focus": 1
    },
    {
        "text": "S- sorry. I was holding back as much as I could.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Texas"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_103_angel_1#3"
    },
    {
        "text": "But at least we're all back together. Now we gotta go find the boss.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Exusiai"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_103_angel_1#7"
    },
    {
        "text": "Wait, why do I feel like we're missing something?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Exusiai"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_102_texas_1"
    },
    {
        "text": "Huh?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Texas"
    },
    {
        "text": "...where's Bison?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Texas"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_103_angel_1#7",
        "name2": "char_102_texas_1",
        "focus": 1
    },
    {
        "text": "What? Wasn't he with you guys?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Exusiai"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_103_angel_1#7",
        "name2": "char_102_texas_1",
        "focus": 2
    },
    {
        "text": "......",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Texas"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_101_sora_1#3"
    },
    {
        "text": "...We didn't leave him back there did we?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Sora"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_102_texas_1#2",
        "name2": "char_101_sora_1#3",
        "focus": 1
    },
    {
        "text": "...We're so used to doing things our own way, leaving him behind was kind of inevitable.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Texas"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_102_texas_1#2",
        "name2": "char_101_sora_1#3",
        "focus": 2
    },
    {
        "text": "So then we should probably go back and get him?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Sora"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_103_angel_1#4"
    },
    {
        "text": "Isn't Mostima here? I think he'll be okay.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Exusiai"
    },
    {
        "tag": "dialog"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character"
    },
    {
        "tag": "blocker",
        "a": 1,
        "r": 0,
        "g": 0,
        "b": 0,
        "fadetime": 0.5,
        "block": true
    },
    {
        "tag": "blocker",
        "a": 0,
        "fadetime": 0.5,
        "block": true
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_325_bison_1#4"
    },
    {
        "text": "Hey! W- waait up! *Cough* *hack*",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Bison"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_101_sora_1#3"
    },
    {
        "text": "...A bicycle?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Sora"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_201_moeshd"
    },
    {
        "text": "Wowee! If you'n keep up with Texas on a bicycle, yer somethin' else, Bison!",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Croissant"
    },
    {
        "tag": "dialog"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character"
    },
    {
        "tag": "blocker",
        "a": 1,
        "r": 0,
        "g": 0,
        "b": 0,
        "fadetime": 0.5,
        "block": true
    },
    {
        "tag": "blocker",
        "a": 0,
        "fadetime": 0.5,
        "block": true
    },
    {
        "text": "Hey! Which alley'd he go down?!",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Mafioso"
    },
    {
        "text": "That way!",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Mafioso"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_103_angel_1#4"
    },
    {
        "text": "He's got a lot of guys on his tail.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Exusiai"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_102_texas_1"
    },
    {
        "text": "Let's not be too hard on the kid who shook off a crew of armed mobsters on a bicycle.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Texas"
    },
    {
        "text": "...No, it's an ambush. Exusiai!",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Texas"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_103_angel_1#4"
    },
    {
        "text": "A little late for that!",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Exusiai"
    },
    {
        "tag": "dialog"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character"
    },
    {
        "tag": "blocker",
        "a": 1,
        "r": 0,
        "g": 0,
        "b": 0,
        "fadetime": 0.5,
        "block": true
    },
    {
        "tag": "blocker",
        "a": 0,
        "fadetime": 0.5,
        "block": true
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_325_bison_1#4"
    },
    {
        "text": "Nng!",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Bison"
    },
    {
        "text": "I did it! I caught them!",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Bison"
    },
    {
        "tag": "stopmusic",
        "fadetime": 1
    },
    {
        "tag": "character"
    },
    {
        "text": "Sure did. Thanks for leading the way.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Gambino"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_325_bison_1#4"
    },
    {
        "text": "Who\u2014\u2014",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Bison"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_028"
    },
    {
        "text": "Good night, sweet prince.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Gambino"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_325_bison_1"
    },
    {
        "tag": "playsound",
        "key": "$fightgeneral"
    },
    {
        "tag": "camerashake",
