        "xstrength": 10,
        "ystrength": 12,
        "vibrato": 30,
        "randomness": 90,
        "fadeout": true,
        "block": true
    },
    {
        "text": "Oof.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Bison"
    },
    {
        "tag": "dialog"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "fadetime": 1,
        "block": true
    },
    {
        "tag": "delay",
        "time": 1
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_102_texas_1"
    },
    {
        "text": "Damn. A second too late.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Texas"
    },
    {
        "tag": "playmusic",
        "intro": "$darkalley_intro",
        "key": "$darkalley_loop",
        "volume": 0.8,
        "crossfade": 1.5
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_028#4"
    },
    {
        "text": "Good evening, Penguin Logistics. I am Gambino Ricci, head of the Family.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Gambino"
    },
    {
        "text": "And it looks like I've got a hostage.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Gambino"
    },
    {
        "text": "But you ain't gonna make a scene over a little thing like this, eh?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Gambino"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_103_angel_1#7",
        "name2": "char_201_moeshd",
        "focus": 1
    },
    {
        "text": "We left him behind...",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Exusiai"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_103_angel_1#7",
        "name2": "char_201_moeshd#5",
        "focus": 2
    },
    {
        "text": "Ain't that the honest truth.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Croissant"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_102_texas_1"
    },
    {
        "text": "What do you want?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Texas"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_028#4",
        "name2": "char_102_texas_1",
        "focus": 1
    },
    {
        "text": "Hmph... I'm sick of you scuttling around like cockroaches, getting into my business, makin' yourselves a real pain in my tail.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Gambino"
    },
    {
        "text": "That's the value of the little prince here. I got a hostage and all you can do is take me head on.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Gambino"
    },
    {
        "text": "And that'll save me a lotta trouble. That turns my little penguin problem into a very solvable problem.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Gambino"
    },
    {
        "text": "Penguin Logistics got nowhere to run.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Gambino"
    },
    {
        "tag": "stopmusic",
        "fadetime": 2
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_028#4",
        "name2": "char_102_texas_1",
        "focus": 2
    },
    {
        "text": "Yeah, okay. Great. Just the way I like it.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Texas"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_028",
        "name2": "char_102_texas_1",
        "focus": 1
    },
    {
        "text": "...What?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Gambino"
    },
    {
        "tag": "playmusic",
        "intro": "$chasing_intro",
        "key": "$chasing_loop",
        "volume": 0.8,
        "crossfade": 1.5
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_028",
        "name2": "char_102_texas_1",
        "focus": 2
    },
    {
        "text": "Turns out we're thinking in the same direction.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Texas"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_102_texas_1#4"
    },
    {
        "text": "Croissant, Sora, form up.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Texas"
    },
    {
        "text": "Exusiai, cover us.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Texas"
    },
    {
        "text": "Let's get our Bison back.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Texas"
    },
